EmberBSD Schematic Analyzer combines KiCad's electrical netlist and ERC with
the schematic drawing's wire graph, symbol transforms and sheet identities.
It reports cycle, overlap and detour candidates, checks explicit voltage and
connection facts, and produces JSON, HTML and per-sheet SVG graphs.

It reads schematics only and never rewrites the source design. Rotation costs
are measurements, not clearance-checked placement recommendations. KiCad and
KiUtils are shared dependencies, not bundled copies.
